<title>UK: NOK sets 250 million 9-year Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>NOK sets 250 million 9-year Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Zurcher Kantonalbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDOSSCHWEIZERISCHE KRAFTWERKE</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    29.MAY.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    29.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     DENOMS (K) 5	   EOS	   15.MAY.97</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE. VALOREN NO 626630</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
